// bread, farms -> swine farms -> butchers make sausages and the skins go to tanneries; gold ore and coal make coins at the
// mint, iron ore and coal make iron at the smelter. Coins pay the school (serfs, builders, recruits). Construction sites
// wait for their planks and stone. A soldier is a recruit plus his kit from the storehouse: militia an axe, axe fighters
// an axe, a wooden shield and leather armour, bowmen a bow and leather armour, swordsmen a sword and iron armour.
// Soldiers eat bread at the inn; hungry soldiers lose health.
